veyard: see who hasn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:36:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031581","verified_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5099810-1847286114028231","game_id":"steam-5099810","kind":"announcement","title":"Heart Fabel Developer Live Stream","summary":"This is a 2D side-scrolling simulation-management game. The whole city is split open in cross-section, and inside every room you can watch the Shanhai folk live their daily lives — who's sleeping, who's cooking, each going about their day. Drag a box to carve out a room, then place beds and build stoves. Roads, ladders, hanging baskets — everything slots in right where you want it. And the best part: wherever the city spreads, the dusty, grey mountains-and-waters spring back to color, like watch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:46:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028231","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:59:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5099810-1846651706689700","game_id":"steam-5099810","kind":"announcement","title":"Hearth Fable Demo Out Now — Available on Next Fest!","summary":"Hello, friends from all corners of the world!We are a small indie startup, and we're thrilled to bring our game Hearth Fable to this edition of Steam Next Fest.We've made a management sim themed around the Classic of Mountains and Seas. As the scroll unfurls, you must survive in the world painted upon it: keep gathering resources, build up your village, and in the end raise that magnificent wonder!The demo is now live and we'd love to hear your feedback. We know that for a small team like ours, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:25:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5099810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5099810":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5099810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z"},"5302770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:13Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5099810","app_id":5099810,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:30Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7d19fc1152d7e32cdd777a8c910aa843b04fd22d122a12ce7f090e1a06e5a166","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Hearth Fable is an ink-wash city-building management sim. Start with a blank scroll: gather wood, build trades, govern people, raise exotic beasts, and repel invaders as you paint your mountain-and-sea scroll step by step toward a paradise of your dreams.","publishers":[{"name":"Silverdew Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Silverdew Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"FableMV_1080pEN","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792401557","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5099810/8065594